                  <provenance type="#c"><orgName role="fmo" key="mlgbOrg_416">Osney, Oxfordshire.
                        Augustinian abbey of St Mary the Virgin. </orgName><p>A liturgical
                        miscellany for Osney, including a calendar, necrology, ordinale, tonal,
                        orders for processions and refectory reading, profession of new canons, and
                        a list of abbots (fols. 164v--165r, datable to 1288--97).</p><p>Contents
                        described by S. J. P. van Dijk, Latin Liturgical Manuscripts and Printed
                        Books, exh. cat. (Oxford 1952), 49, and id. Handlist III. 220. See also R.
                        W. Pfaff, Liturgy in Medieval England (Cambridge 2009), 278--9; Salter,
